WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:03.890
After our guests saw the life-changing effects

2
00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:05.460
of a good makeover,

3
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.210
they created a non-profit dedicated

4
00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.050
to helping women in need.

5
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:14.270
And the organization is called My Fairy Godfathers

6
00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:16.310
and founders Steven Anderson

7
00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:19.790
and Andrew Ashton are here with us now.

8
00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:22.136
Hi guys.
(audience cheering)

9
00:00:22.136 --> 00:00:23.570
Hey!
Hi Drew!

10
00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.634
Nice to see you.
How are you?

11
00:00:25.634 --> 00:00:26.467
Oh my God!

12
00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:28.700
You guys look like fairy godfathers.

13
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:33.700
Like, like I see you and you've got that smile and you look

14
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.910
like you're awake and alive

15
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:40.300
and like ready to fly in and change people's lives.

16
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.493
I can see it all over you.

17
00:00:42.493 --> 00:00:44.220
Our wings are in the back.

18
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.350
We took them off.

19
00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:46.183
That's it.

20
00:00:46.183 --> 00:00:48.547
I see the wings, I do.

21
00:00:48.547 --> 00:00:50.030
(Steven and Andrew laughing)

22
00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:51.880
It's the glimmer in your eye

23
00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:54.730
and the smiles on your faces.

24
00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:56.800
And Stephen, as a hairstylist

25
00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.770
you say that like seeing the confidence

26
00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:03.170
in a woman after she gets a haircut,

27
00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:07.930
it inspired you to do something even more beautiful.

28
00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:09.053
Can you explain that?

29
00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:12.730 line:15%
Well, yeah, I mean, we work on women every single day.

30
00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:17.260 line:15%
We work on men and women, but women primarily, and you know

31
00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:18.840
those few minutes that we're in the chair

32
00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:21.310
with that person, you make a change.

33
00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:23.650
We make them feel really good.

34
00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:27.760
But we were approached to help a young girl

35
00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:31.720
go to the prom if we would donate hair and makeup to her.

36
00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:35.100
And we did, we said, sure, we would do that.

37
00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.430
But we decided we would take it a little bit further.

38
00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:39.410
We asked her about her dress.

39
00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:40.710
She said she had a dress.

40
00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:42.557
And then we looked at it and we said,

41
00:01:42.557 --> 00:01:44.470
"Ooh, no, can't do that."

42
00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:48.300
So we decided to create a dress for her

43
00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.430
and it just kind of blossomed from there.

44
00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:54.890
And when we finished with the whole transformation,

45
00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:56.367
she looked at herself and she's like,

46
00:01:56.367 --> 00:01:58.670
"Wow, you guys are like my fairy godfathers."

47
00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:01.460
And that's kind of how the name stuck.

48
00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:04.100
Well, and Andrew, you've worked with some women

49
00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.670
who are facing some serious issues.

50
00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:10.150
And I was wondering if you would tell me about these women.

51
00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.900
Oh, wow.

52
00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.903
You know, we've helped over 750 women so far,

53
00:02:13.903 --> 00:02:16.650
since Stephen and I began this journey.

54
00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.390
And we've worked with women that have

55
00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:21.194
been through catastrophic illness

56
00:02:21.194 --> 00:02:23.600 line:15%
or through financial hardship

57
00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:26.570 line:15%
and a lot of times beyond their control.

58
00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:28.490 line:15%
So we just felt like we needed to go in

59
00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:31.300
and let them feel their beauty again

60
00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:33.300
and feel confident and empowered.

61
00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:36.670
And I think sometimes when you feel low,

62
00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:38.710
when you're going through catastrophic illness

63
00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:40.530
and you've had to cut off all your hair,

64
00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.420
if you're going through chemo,

65
00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:44.100
you just wanna feel like yourself.

66
00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.480
You wanna feel beautiful again.

67
00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.820
And so that's why we created the, you know

68
00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.940
give wigs to women that are going through all this.

69
00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:51.660
And we sit with them and we talk with them

70
00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:52.542
and we style them out

71
00:02:52.542 --> 00:02:54.660
and we go through everything that we need to

72
00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.710
to make them feel beautiful again.

73
00:02:56.710 --> 00:03:00.403
Well, we actually reached out to some these women,

74
00:03:01.382 --> 00:03:02.215
You did?
(Stephen laughing)

75
00:03:02.215 --> 00:03:04.040
Yeah, we have a little surprise for you.

76
00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:04.910
Check this out.

77
00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.393
Oh, no way!

78
00:03:06.393 --> 00:03:07.320 line:15%
(inspiring music)

79
00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:10.430 line:15%
Hi, Steven and Andrew, it's been so long

80
00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.870
since I've been able to be blessed with your presence.

81
00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:14.460
I definitely want to say thank you

82
00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.230
for everything that you did for me.

83
00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:18.610
I left my senior prom feeling

84
00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.800
like I was ready for the world.

85
00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.400 line:15%
When I met them, I was lost.

86
00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.720
I just didn't know there was more to life.

87
00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.310
Like they helped me realize that.

88
00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:31.660 line:15%
To have My Fairy Godfathers be able to step in,

89
00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.010
in a moment where I needed them most

90
00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:39.010
was so instrumental in my journey and my confidence.

91
00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:42.330 line:15%
As a mom watching your child battle cancer,

92
00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:45.560
it was just the social part of it,

93
00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:46.930
about feeling beautiful.

94
00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:48.766
And they just wanted to make her feel

95
00:03:48.766 --> 00:03:50.520
like a pretty princess.

96
00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:51.567 line:15%
I mean, I...

97
00:03:56.610 --> 00:04:00.200
Having my baby girl with me,

98
00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:03.651
seeing her face lit up because my face lit up,

99
00:04:03.651 --> 00:04:08.350
and her, you know, seeing my confidence.

100
00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.720
That is what the organization's about.

101
00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:13.100
It means more than just a wig.

102
00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.490
They gave me my power back.

103
00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:17.520
My fairy godfathers forever.

104
00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.690
You are life changing.

105
00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:23.670
Thank you for what you're doing for women like myself.

106
00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:25.230
Thank you for making me feel

107
00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:28.243
like myself again and make me feel beautiful.

108
00:04:28.243 --> 00:04:31.260
Oh my God.
Oh my God. That's great.

109
00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:34.810
I love to see people that have been in the past.

110
00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:38.560
I'm sorry, because it shows, it shows

111
00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:40.090
that we made a difference for them

112
00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.130
in the short period of time that we were with them

113
00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:44.260
and the experiences that we can give to them,

114
00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.680 line:15%
hopefully they'll remember for their lifetime.

115
00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:47.690 line:15%
So sorry.
(Stephen laughing)

116
00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:50.470 line:15%
No, I mean, what do you feel right now,

117
00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.803 line:15%
out of curiosity?

118
00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.210
Oh, my heart is full.

119
00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:56.510
It's just full of happiness.

120
00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:57.626
It's wonderful.

121
00:04:57.626 --> 00:04:58.659
That was a great surprise.
(audience cheering)

122
00:04:58.659 --> 00:05:00.552
Thank you, so much.
That was great.

123
00:05:00.552 --> 00:05:02.840
It's all both of you.

124
00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:06.380
And you guys are changing so many lives

125
00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:07.750
and as a thank you, by the way,

126
00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:11.140
I started a beauty company 10 years ago, Flower Beauty,

127
00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:15.070
and we are gonna send you a ton of stuff.

128
00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:17.126
I'm talking thousands of dollars worth of -

129
00:05:17.126 --> 00:05:19.550
Thank you.
Great, thank you so much!

130
00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.800
hair tools and makeup,

131
00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:24.450
so that you have that at your disposal.

132
00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:27.400
And we also want to send you each $5,000

133
00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:28.780
totaling in 10.
(audience cheering)

134
00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:32.289
Just, you know, a little something to help

135
00:05:32.289 --> 00:05:37.289
aid and foster what you are already doing.

136
00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.010
Listen, this money doesn't compare.

137
00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:41.630
This is our way of saying thank you

138
00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:43.040
to you and wanting to support

139
00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:46.360
and foster what you are already doing.

140
00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:47.876
Aw, Thank you so much.
Thank you so much.

141
00:05:47.876 --> 00:05:49.936
We really appreciate you having us.

142
00:05:49.936 --> 00:05:50.930
Thank you.
Thank you.

143
00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:55.833 line:15%
Go to our website to learn all about My Fairy Godfathers.

144
00:05:55.833 --> 00:05:58.666 line:15%
(uplifting music)

